# Why This Works

Because `nums` is sorted:

* If two adjacent numbers differ by more than `maxDiff`, no intermediate value can bridge that gap.
* Therefore, all nodes before the gap and after the gap belong to different connected components.
* If adjacent differences stay within `maxDiff`, every node can reach the next one, forming one connected component.

Thus,

```
Path exists

⇔

Both nodes belong to the same component.
```

